==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{term|purveu||lang=enm|proviso}}, from {{etyl|xno|en}} {{term|purveuest||lang=xno|it is provided}}, or {{term|purveu que||lang=xno|provided that}} (statutory language), from {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|porveu||lang=fro|provided}}, past partiple of {{term|porveoir||lang=rom|to provide}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|provideo||lang=la}} (See [[provide]]). Influenced by {{term|view||lang=en}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

